{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2967850/extras/a28035c64d102fec343b21a5e8925d82.avif?t=1762261372\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2967850/extras_big/a28035c64d102fec343b21a5e8925d82.webp?t=1762261372 width=1560 height=110 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2967850/extras/e70ef511a6bae8df629a47676d70e817.avif?t=1762261372\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2967850/extras_big/e70ef511a6bae8df629a47676d70e817.webp?t=1762261372 width=1560 height=110 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You will rent and sell various guns, ammo packs, equipment, and more. Track your inventory and restock when needed to make sure you have them all for the next customer's order. You can hire a stocker later to help you out!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2967850/extras/3662ebe1c6271d2215f5e1dcd28470da.poster.avif?t=1762261372\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2967850/extras/3662ebe1c6271d2215f5e1dcd28470da.webm?t=1762261372\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2967850/extras/3662ebe1c6271d2215f5e1dcd28470da.mp4?t=1762261372\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2967850/extras/7a15fff4901b6f195c665201fcc1aa03.avif?t=1762261372\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2967850/extras_big/7a15fff4901b6f195c665201fcc1aa03.webp?t=1762261372 width=1560 height=110 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customers are going to ask you for a specific combination of gun, ammo pack, and equipment. Match each of them and collect your money!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2967850/extras/35c8f7ce756b2bc72bd74ac9accbc7af.poster.avif?t=1762261372\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2967850/extras/35c8f7ce756b2bc72bd74ac9accbc7af.webm?t=1762261372\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2967850/extras/35c8f7ce756b2bc72bd74ac9accbc7af.mp4?t=1762261372\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2967850/extras/ec7ca039d3beee2621766548f7ce3baa.avif?t=1762261372\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2967850/extras_big/ec7ca039d3beee2621766548f7ce3baa.webp?t=1762261372 width=1560 height=110 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Test your luck with these random cases! Obtain various skins to sell or complete bundles to earn more money. As you level up, you will get more case options to choose from!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2967850/extras/0c5c4fc9ecc235dd1458726ce1af62a1.poster.avif?t=1762261372\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2967850/extras/0c5c4fc9ecc235dd1458726ce1af62a1.webm?t=1762261372\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2967850/extras/0c5c4fc9ecc235dd1458726ce1af62a1.mp4?t=1762261372\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2967850/extras/c2ff999475fc1d74e76ede18cd3b03c6.avif?t=1762261372\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2967850/extras_big/c2ff999475fc1d74e76ede18cd3b03c6.webp?t=1762261372 width=1560 height=110 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Put a price tag on it, follow market prices, and attract more customers. Hunt down rare skins to get rich quick!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2967850/extras/52c4976541c26b07b2ed53a55ceeed82.poster.avif?t=1762261372\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2967850/extras/52c4976541c26b07b2ed53a55ceeed82.webm?t=1762261372\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2967850/extras/52c4976541c26b07b2ed53a55ceeed82.mp4?t=1762261372\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2967850/extras/6866f76c1119305fb5efb5cbfefec024.avif?t=1762261372\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2967850/extras_big/6866f76c1119305fb5efb5cbfefec024.webp?t=1762261372 width=1560 height=110 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rented guns get worn out with time; buy a cleaning station to clean them regularly. Use different sprays to protect them longer. You can later upgrade it for an automated version to save time!<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2967850/extras/c5db6bec98e1a94cee00017aa1c25c49.poster.avif?t=1762261372\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2967850/extras/c5db6bec98e1a94cee00017aa1c25c49.webm?t=1762261372\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2967850/extras/c5db6bec98e1a94cee00017aa1c25c49.mp4?t=1762261372\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2967850/extras/589d6f1775493eb6f2465d0bccaf5d28.avif?t=1762261372\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2967850/extras_big/589d6f1775493eb6f2465d0bccaf5d28.webp?t=1762261372 width=1560 height=110 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you think you have what it takes, join a shooting race. Compete with various guns and earn some quick money if you win!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2967850/extras/09178ff1e145110f68827de87b44cb9c.poster.avif?t=1762261372\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2967850/extras/09178ff1e145110f68827de87b44cb9c.webm?t=1762261372\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2967850/extras/09178ff1e145110f68827de87b44cb9c.mp4?t=1762261372\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2967850/extras/b10731ce5101fd5824f9dc68140b9aae.avif?t=1762261372\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2967850/extras_big/b10731ce5101fd5824f9dc68140b9aae.webp?t=1762261372 width=1560 height=110 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the beginning you have very limited space and have to manually maintain your range, but as you upgrade, your range has more space and time-saving features like automated target placement! Customers always want better and are willing to pay more money!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2967850/extras/713ba308ded11d2bcf733a8840b1a5f0.poster.avif?t=1762261372\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2967850/extras/713ba308ded11d2bcf733a8840b1a5f0.webm?t=1762261372\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2967850/extras/713ba308ded11d2bcf733a8840b1a5f0.mp4?t=1762261372\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2967850/extras/97b8a8050d5d8823f4a28af729ec4ba1.avif?t=1762261372\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2967850/extras_big/97b8a8050d5d8823f4a28af729ec4ba1.webp?t=1762261372 width=1560 height=110 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Throw your trash out, collect empty shells, and even recycle them to earn money! Upgrade your tools to make it easier.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2967850/extras/16b47975486a4f6f0ce1073934f5c30b.poster.avif?t=1762261372\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2967850/extras/16b47975486a4f6f0ce1073934f5c30b.webm?t=1762261372\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2967850/extras/16b47975486a4f6f0ce1073934f5c30b.mp4?t=1762261372\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Second Shooting Range","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2967850/ba3f8ccfed28de4f6cb73dc8ae5366cbac9a937d.jpg"},{"name":"First Exhibit","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2967850/db36c665f46b0c1ce5d011eefcab961d162e46cd.jpg"},{"name":"Collector","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2967850/4964354ffe572d56ffe5aaf705c11abc867c98c6.jpg"},{"name":"Master Curator","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2967850/3b11277abcef8c4d65c6dbcf750c99cdcd2a13e1.jpg"},{"name":"First Customer","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2967850/168277481b748fc3d574d6c09626ed98c0e9f553.jpg"},{"name":"Busy Day","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2967850/bfb5e24f06dccb28ec878d068108c2812113b33d.jpg"},{"name":"Legendary Operator","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2967850/25a0bb4ea4e52c958d0ba1bc3ae49ec9d1ee61ae.jpg"},{"name":"Smooth Talker","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2967850/918957ae6c5115e7e2bd2ff2f8cf5f3104d5a781.jpg"},{"name":"Silver-Tongued Negotiator","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2967850/a0db0891fed1afea1f3f3dd4903155dab98de9e6.jpg"},{"name":"Master of Deals","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2967850/14f6c03462bfac235ca2c961a0e36fd590aee07e.jpg"}],"total":30},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2967850?t=1762261372","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2967850/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1762261372","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2967850/df2b591c9ee3b94b7ffbb56980174c67ad27e637/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1762261372","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2967850/df2b591c9ee3b94b7ffbb56980174c67ad27e637/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1762261372","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2967850/extras/a28035c64d102fec343b21a5e8925d82.avif?t=1762261372\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2967850/extras_big/a28035c64d102fec343b21a5e8925d82.webp?t=1762261372 width=1560 height=110 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2967850/extras/e70ef511a6bae8df629a47676d70e817.avif?t=1762261372\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2967850/extras_big/e70ef511a6bae8df629a47676d70e817.webp?t=1762261372 width=1560 height=110 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You will rent and sell various guns, ammo packs, equipment, and more. Track your inventory and restock when needed to make sure you have them all for the next customer's order. You can hire a stocker later to help you out!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2967850/extras/3662ebe1c6271d2215f5e1dcd28470da.poster.avif?t=1762261372\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2967850/extras/3662ebe1c6271d2215f5e1dcd28470da.webm?t=1762261372\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2967850/extras/3662ebe1c6271d2215f5e1dcd28470da.mp4?t=1762261372\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2967850/extras/7a15fff4901b6f195c665201fcc1aa03.avif?t=1762261372\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2967850/extras_big/7a15fff4901b6f195c665201fcc1aa03.webp?t=1762261372 width=1560 height=110 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customers are going to ask you for a specific combination of gun, ammo pack, and equipment. Match each of them and collect your money!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2967850/extras/35c8f7ce756b2bc72bd74ac9accbc7af.poster.avif?t=1762261372\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2967850/extras/35c8f7ce756b2bc72bd74ac9accbc7af.webm?t=1762261372\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2967850/extras/35c8f7ce756b2bc72bd74ac9accbc7af.mp4?t=1762261372\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2967850/extras/ec7ca039d3beee2621766548f7ce3baa.avif?t=1762261372\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2967850/extras_big/ec7ca039d3beee2621766548f7ce3baa.webp?t=1762261372 width=1560 height=110 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Test your luck with these random cases! Obtain various skins to sell or complete bundles to earn more money. As you level up, you will get more case options to choose from!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2967850/extras/0c5c4fc9ecc235dd1458726ce1af62a1.poster.avif?t=1762261372\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2967850/extras/0c5c4fc9ecc235dd1458726ce1af62a1.webm?t=1762261372\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2967850/extras/0c5c4fc9ecc235dd1458726ce1af62a1.mp4?t=1762261372\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2967850/extras/c2ff999475fc1d74e76ede18cd3b03c6.avif?t=1762261372\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2967850/extras_big/c2ff999475fc1d74e76ede18cd3b03c6.webp?t=1762261372 width=1560 height=110 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Put a price tag on it, follow market prices, and attract more customers. Hunt down rare skins to get rich quick!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2967850/extras/52c4976541c26b07b2ed53a55ceeed82.poster.avif?t=1762261372\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2967850/extras/52c4976541c26b07b2ed53a55ceeed82.webm?t=1762261372\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2967850/extras/52c4976541c26b07b2ed53a55ceeed82.mp4?t=1762261372\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2967850/extras/6866f76c1119305fb5efb5cbfefec024.avif?t=1762261372\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2967850/extras_big/6866f76c1119305fb5efb5cbfefec024.webp?t=1762261372 width=1560 height=110 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rented guns get worn out with time; buy a cleaning station to clean them regularly. Use different sprays to protect them longer. You can later upgrade it for an automated version to save time!<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2967850/extras/c5db6bec98e1a94cee00017aa1c25c49.poster.avif?t=1762261372\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2967850/extras/c5db6bec98e1a94cee00017aa1c25c49.webm?t=1762261372\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2967850/extras/c5db6bec98e1a94cee00017aa1c25c49.mp4?t=1762261372\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2967850/extras/589d6f1775493eb6f2465d0bccaf5d28.avif?t=1762261372\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2967850/extras_big/589d6f1775493eb6f2465d0bccaf5d28.webp?t=1762261372 width=1560 height=110 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you think you have what it takes, join a shooting race. Compete with various guns and earn some quick money if you win!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2967850/extras/09178ff1e145110f68827de87b44cb9c.poster.avif?t=1762261372\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2967850/extras/09178ff1e145110f68827de87b44cb9c.webm?t=1762261372\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2967850/extras/09178ff1e145110f68827de87b44cb9c.mp4?t=1762261372\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2967850/extras/b10731ce5101fd5824f9dc68140b9aae.avif?t=1762261372\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2967850/extras_big/b10731ce5101fd5824f9dc68140b9aae.webp?t=1762261372 width=1560 height=110 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the beginning you have very limited space and have to manually maintain your range, but as you upgrade, your range has more space and time-saving features like automated target placement! Customers always want better and are willing to pay more money!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2967850/extras/713ba308ded11d2bcf733a8840b1a5f0.poster.avif?t=1762261372\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2967850/extras/713ba308ded11d2bcf733a8840b1a5f0.webm?t=1762261372\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2967850/extras/713ba308ded11d2bcf733a8840b1a5f0.mp4?t=1762261372\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2967850/extras/97b8a8050d5d8823f4a28af729ec4ba1.avif?t=1762261372\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2967850/extras_big/97b8a8050d5d8823f4a28af729ec4ba1.webp?t=1762261372 width=1560 height=110 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Throw your trash out, collect empty shells, and even recycle them to earn money! Upgrade your tools to make it easier.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2967850/extras/16b47975486a4f6f0ce1073934f5c30b.poster.avif?t=1762261372\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2967850/extras/16b47975486a4f6f0ce1073934f5c30b.webm?t=1762261372\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2967850/extras/16b47975486a4f6f0ce1073934f5c30b.mp4?t=1762261372\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","developers":["Buffed Games"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"},{"description":"Early Access","id":"70"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2967850/2157cafa94290597437e264918cb32d088dbeab3/header.jpg?t=1762261372","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommen